# Reviewed standalone pages and their evidence depend on exact bytes.
/.agents/skills/ds-interactive/** -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
"/복습노트/**/인터렉티브_*.html" -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
